===Merchandise===
====Movie Commemoration VS Pack: Sky-Splitting Deoxys====
Celebrating the release of ''[[M07|Destiny Deoxys]]'' in cinemas, the '''{{TCG|Movie Commemoration VS Pack: Sky-Splitting Deoxys}}''' (Japanese: '''映画公開記念VSパック 裂空のデオキシス''') was made available first on July 17, 2004 exclusively in Pokémon Centers, followed by a more general release on August 14, 2004. Prominent Pokémon include Sky-Splitting {{p|Deoxys}}, featured in two of its formes and Sky's {{p|Rayquaza}}. Other cards include Pokémon native to the movie's primary setting [[LaRousse City]], as well as Pokémon belonging to characters appearing in the movie. The half deck also comes with a special {{wp|lenticular image}} card depicting the formes of Sky-Splitting Deoxys, a rulebook, damage counters, status counters, and a coin.

