==Trivia==
[[File:Deoxys crystal.png|thumb|200px|The green-crystal Deoxys in its crystal form]]
* The research [[Professor Lund]] used on these Deoxys later benefited [[Solana]] in [[AG171|a later episode of the series]]. However, the Deoxys featured in that episode was not the same as these.
* Due to the fact that ''Destiny Deoxys'' was produced before the release of {{game|Emerald}}, neither of these Deoxys appear in their Speed Formes.
* The purple-crystal Deoxys's ability to duplicate itself is [[List of cross-canon references|referenced]] in [[Pokémon Adventures]], where {{adv|Deoxys}} gains the same kind of ability after being {{pkmn2|caught}} by {{adv|Giovanni}}.
